     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the following actors: </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.FHIRModeller.html\">FHIR Modeller</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"BUILD-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher locally</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher build process locally and interpret build output.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BUILD-02\"> </a></b>Verify GitHub Pages build</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify CI builds on GitHub Pages (org.github.io/repo for default branch, /branches/branch_name for other branches).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BUILD-03\"> </a></b>Verify FHIR build</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify builds on build.fhir.org/ig/ for tooling and registry recognition.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BUILD-04\"> </a></b>Interpret build errors</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret IG Publisher build errors and resolve common issues (missing dependencies, invalid references, SUSHI errors).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent aux acteurs suivants : </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.FHIRModeller.html\">FHIR Modeller</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BUILD-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher locally</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher build process locally and interpret build output.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BUILD-02\"> </a></b>Verify GitHub Pages build</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify CI builds on GitHub Pages (org.github.io/repo for default branch, /branches/branch_name for other branches).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BUILD-03\"> </a></b>Verify FHIR build</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify builds on build.fhir.org/ig/ for tooling and registry recognition.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BUILD-04\"> </a></b>Interpret build errors</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret IG Publisher build errors and resolve common issues (missing dependencies, invalid references, SUSHI errors).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.BuildIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الجهات التالية </p><ul><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></li><li><a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.FHIRModeller.html\">FHIR Modeller</a></li></ul><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BUILD-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher locally</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher build process locally and interpret build output.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BUILD-02\"> </a></b>Verify GitHub Pages build</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify CI builds on GitHub